射（map）<MATH_0026>。因此只需构造映射（map）<MATH_0027>，为此取<MATH_0028>中的元素（element），它对应于典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0029>，后者属于<MATH_0030>。最后考虑 (5)。由<MATH_0031>的泛性质（universal property），只需构造映射（map）\n<MATH_0032>\n为此，利用交换约束（commutativity constraint）交换最后两个张量积（tensor products），再使用映射（maps）<MATH_0033>和<MATH_0034>。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:9617e10387dcb4dce3b32d2c2ff7f2f633cf9dd8086aed6d98910011a80a574a", "unit_id": "tag:0GWJ:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "给定的范畴；待决。", "source_term": "monoidal category", "target_term": "幺半范畴"}, {"context": "由张量积伴随性质确定的对象；待决。", "source_term": "internal hom", "target_term": "内部 Hom"}, {"context": "内部 Hom 的两个变量；待决。", "source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "代表内部 Hom 的对象；待决。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "所给等式对三个变量的性质；待决。", "source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "具有函子性"}, {"context": "唯一性依据；待决。", "source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"context": "内部 Hom 的双函子；待决。", "source_term": "bifunctor", "target_term": "双函子"}, {"context": "唯一性同构；待决。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "列出的五个构造；待决。", "source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"context": "典范构造及其分量；待决。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "第五个构造所需条件；待决。", "source_term": "symmetric monoidal", "target_term": "对称幺半的"}, {"context": "五个构造中的各个映射；待决。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "恒等态射在伴随对应下的像；待决。", "source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"context": "单位对象到内部 Hom 的态射；待决。", "source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"context": "单位张量约束；待决。", "source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"context": "内部 Hom 的定义性质；待决。", "source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"context": "构造第五个映射时交换因子；待决。", "source_term": "commutativity constraint", "target_term": "交换约束"}, {"context": "最后两个张量积；待决。", "source_term": "tensor products", "target_term": "张量积"}]}
